er-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Provenance papers</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Supplied to the gallery by S. Laurent</div></div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; color: #A4161A; margin-top: 8px; transform: rotate(-1deg)\">The lab keeps a copy of the provenance papers.</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Sophie Laurent", "motive": "Blue Harbour was a forgery, and the provenance papers came from Sophie. She stole the fake and tore out the papers to hide her fraud before Marcus saw it (clues 5 and 6).", "proof": ["The stairwell camera runs one hour behind (clue 5): Jonas' rounds at 19:55 and 20:31 on camera match his real rounds at 20:55 and 21:31 (clue 2).", "So the woman in black really went down at 21:04 and came up at 21:12 – with a tube bag big enough for a rolled canvas (clue 2).", "At 21:04–21:12 Elise was giving her talk, and Camille was on the terrace with Victor (clues 3 and 4). Sophie was the only woman without an alibi.", "Henri asked ‘S.’ to bring the provenance folder – the one found with its pages torn out (clues 1 and 5)."], "cleared": ["<b>Camille</b> looks guilty if you trust the camera clock (alone at 20:00), but at the real time she was with Victor (clue 4).", "<b>Elise</b> was on stage 21:00–21:25 (clue 3).", "<b>Victor, Marcus and Jonas</b> are men – the camera shows a woman (clue 2)."]}}, {"slug": "death-in-the-snow", "level": 2, "crime": "Murder", "who": "killer", "title": "Death in the Snow", "teaser": "Snowed in at a mountain chalet, the host is found dead in the ski shed. The snow remembers who walked there.", "intro": "Chalet owner <b>Bernard Kroll</b> has been found dead in the ski shed behind his chalet. The storm has cut off the road – the killer is still in the house. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "Chalet owner Bernard Kroll has been found dead in the ski shed behind his chalet. The storm has cut off the road – the killer is still in the house. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-14", "suspects": [{"name": "Ingrid Kroll", "role": "Bernard's wife"}, {"name": "Sven Olsen", "role": "Caretaker"}, {"name": "Lena Fischer", "role": "Chef"}, {"name": "Max Hartmann", "role": "Bernard's nephew"}, {"name": "Pierre Moreau", "role": "Neighbour and guest"}, {"name": "Anton Berg", "role": "Bernard's business partner"}], "clues": [{"name": "Ingrid Kroll", "role": "Bernard's wife", "quote": "Bernard went out to check the skis at a quarter to eleven. When he didn't come back I thought he'd gone to bed in the guest room – we'd quarrelled. I played cards all night.", "label": "SCENE REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Scene report – ski shed, 100 m behind the chalet</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Found</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: