: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">Theatre producer <b>Isadora Vance</b> has been found dead in her dressing room during the theatre's masked ball. Everyone wore a costume – and a witness saw the Raven leave her room. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"130\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 130\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"44\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#B9B0A2\"></circle><path d=\"M8 130 C8 92 30 80 60 80 C90 80 112 92 112 130 Z\" fill=\"#B9B0A2\"></path></svg></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Theo Marsh</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Director</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”Isadora was cutting my contract, yes. But at half past ten I was on stage giving the welcome speech – three hundred people saw me. Then Oscar ran the auction.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · THEO MARSH</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #4 · BALL PROGRAMME</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 22px; color: #1E1B18; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px\">The Masked Ball</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: #5C554D; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px\">PROGRAMME</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #B9B0A2\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; width: 64px; color: #1E1B18\">22:00</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1E1B18\">Doors &amp; punch</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #B9B0A2\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; width: 64px; color: #1E1B18\">22:30</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; co