unce a discovery, someone smashed the telescope's mirror cover and deleted the night's images. The control log points straight at one person. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "The night before Prof Helena Ross was due to announce a discovery, someone smashed the telescope's mirror cover and deleted the night's images. The control log points straight at one person. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-14", "suspects": [{"name": "Helena Ross", "role": "Professor of astronomy"}, {"name": "Tom Fletcher", "role": "Technician"}, {"name": "Priya Nair", "role": "PhD student"}, {"name": "Greta Lind", "role": "Science journalist"}, {"name": "Ian Shaw", "role": "Rival astronomer"}, {"name": "Ada Kim", "role": "Observatory director"}], "clues": [{"name": "Helena Ross", "role": "Professor of astronomy", "quote": "I started the telescope at twenty to eleven and drove to the village for dinner with my husband. At half past one I came back to this. Those images would have changed everything.", "label": "DAMAGE REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Damage report – main dome</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Discovered</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">01:30, by Prof Ross</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: