: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">€50,000 paid in by ‘Orage’ for ‘advice’</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Hugo Fabre", "motive": "The rival house Orage paid Hugo €50,000 (clue 6).", "proof": ["The safe's clock was still on summer time (clue 2). The clocks went back at 03:00 (clue 1), so ‘04:35’ on the safe was really <b>03:35</b>, and it closed at 03:52.", "Hugo took a taxi to Maison Lune at 03:10, arrived at 03:25 and left at 03:58 (clue 4).", "He knows the code (clue 6). His video call at 04:15 came after the safe was closed.", "So his claim that he was asleep at home until 04:15 is a lie (clues 4 and 6)."], "cleared": ["<b>Céline</b> was on the phone at home from 03:28 to 03:52 (clue 5). Her taxi at 04:20 was too late.", "<b>Ravi</b> was at the hospital from 01:10 to 06:30 (clue 3).", "<b>Bruno, Ana and Theo</b> don't know the code (clue 1)."]}}, {"slug": "the-glasshouse-blackmail", "level": 2, "crime": "Blackmail", "who": "blackmailer", "title": "The Glasshouse Blackmail", "teaser": "A blackmail photo shows the garden director with a shop-bought prize orchid. A clock in the picture says 10:10. Look again.", "intro": "At Kingsley Botanical Gardens, director <b>Dr Ophelia Rand</b> won the orchid show. Then a blackmail letter arrived – with a photo. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At Kingsley Botanical Gardens, director Dr Ophelia Rand won the orchid show. Then a blackmail letter arrived – with a photo. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-14", "suspects": [{"name": "Dr Ophelia Rand", "role": "Director of the gardens"}, {"name": "Mabel Fry", "role": "Volunteer guide"}, {"name": "Sid Okoro", "role": "Café manager"}, {"name": "Priya Nand", "role": "Orchid Society judge"}, {"name": "Josh Weller", "role": "Delivery driver"}, {"name": "Ken Ashdown", "role": "Head gardener"}], "clues": [{"name": "Dr Ophelia Rand", "role": "Director of the gardens", "quote": "All right – I bought the orchid. Mine died a week before the show, and I panicked. But blackmail is a crime too, and I want to know who sent this.", "label": "BLACKMAIL LETTER", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 18px 22px; transform: rotate(-1deg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 23px, #E3DCCF 24px)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #5C554D\">LETTER – pushed under the office door</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">I have a photo of you in Glasshouse 3,</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">unpacking a SHOP-BOUGHT orchid on Tuesday.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Leave £3,000 in the stone lantern by Friday,</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">or the Orchid Society gets a copy.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; c